SUMMARY:Apex EarthFest
DESCRIPTION:Visit NCWF South Wake Conservationists Chapter at Apex EarthFest! We will be sharing our local wildlife and habitat conservation message with the community\, including nature-based activities for kids. We are seeking a few volunteers to assist with our exhibit\, helping setup or break down and engaging with both kids and adults alike. The exhibit materials are all assembled and ready to go\, so all we need is you! These events are always fun and it is rewarding to engage directly with the local community. Join us for 2 hour shifts or stay for the whole event. See you there! \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/apex-earthfest/
CATEGORIES:Featured
END:VEVENT
